4. FALSE POSITIVE: getValidFileName() - properly uses canonicalization before comparison; path traversal sequences are correctly detected and rejected.

Other Query 3 results (redirect validation, access reference maps, configuration methods) were assessed as not being path traversal vulnerabilities.
